Baselines. We compare MLExpert against two groups of models:
(1) same-scale models , including Qwen3.6-35B-A3B [ 13 ] , Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B [ 14 ] , and Nex-N2.5-mini [ 15 ] ;
and (2) larger frontier models , including DeepSeek-V4-Pro Preview [ 16 ] , MiniMax M3 [ 17 ] , GLM-5.3 [ 18 ] , Kimi-K3 [ 19 ] , GPT-5.5 [ 20 ] , and GPT-5.6 Sol [ 21 ] .

